# Package F "False Papers": Nils has the key to the stash (false_papers_stash) that holds the a forged SIN card.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('false_papers_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Papers are an art. Art has a price. What do you need?
#
o_text: The refugee woman paid you. Give her the papers, or I make sure EBI hears your name.
o_id: false_papers_talk
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(false_papers)') && !HasItem('false_papers_stash_key')
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Easy')
o_succ: Yield
o_fail: Refuse
#
o_text: She can't pay. You can. How much for me to forget her?
o_id: false_papers_bribe
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(false_papers)') && !HasItem('forged_sin') && !HasFlag('false_papers_paid')
o_goto: Bribe
#
o_text: Who buys papers?
o_id: false_papers_lore
o_goto: Lore
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: false_papers_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Lore
npc: Refugees. Runaways. EBI, when they want someone to disappear on paper first. A Saudi passport with a level-three chip, four thousand. The ticket lottery uses my slips too.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: false_papers_lore_back
o_goto: Default

name: Yield
npc: (He sighs, as if bored.) Fine. She paid. Here, the drawer key. Her card's on top.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'false_papers_stash_key', 1)
effect: EndConversation

name: Refuse
npc: EBI buys my papers too. Threaten someone else.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribe
npc: (He smiles.) One-fifty. I'll sell her card to someone who can pay. That's not cruelty. It's a market.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 150)
effect: SetFlag('false_papers_bribed')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Need a new name? Discount for friends.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Stay legal.
effect: EndConversation
